SCRIPT:learn
"建造单位，单位每回合会自动在地图中央战斗。\n电厂提供收入，请记得多造电厂，防止资金不足。\n若帝国建造队列卡住：右键双击锁住的电厂可取消制造。"
END

SCRIPT:learn?english
"Build units. They fight automatically in the center each round.\nPower plants provide income, so remember to build plenty to avoid running out of money.\nIf the Empire build queue gets stuck, right-click twice on the locked power plant to cancel production."
END

SCRIPT:learn_EN
