SCRIPT:text0
"更新：\n1、海军全部出生在上方，海上的塔被摧毁对应陆地塔也会被摧毁，海军进入对方海军出生点会回收为金钱每200/船/人。所有陆军、基洛夫出生点更加靠前，空军出生有10S延时。轰炸机重生在地图外降低轰炸频率。\n2、加上科技锁定，一开始玩家只能建造T1单位，每层科技将在4；10；15回合解锁。并且摧毁对方防御塔的一方可以提前解锁科技。\n3、防爆盾被锁定，蜘蛛默认开启F\n4、取消赏金\n5、T4战舰只能建造两艘，抬高了水面。\n6、神州电厂进行了平衡性调整，前期资金会变少，但后期会更强。"
END

SCRIPT:text0?english
"Update\n1, All navy now spawns at the top; destroying a sea tower also destroys the matching land tower, and a ship entering the enemy naval spawn point is recycled into money at 200 per ship per player. All land units and Kirovs spawn further forward, air units spawn with a 10 s delay, and bombers respawn off the map to lower the bombing rate.\n2, Tech locks are added, players start able to build tier 1 units only, and each tier unlocks on rounds 4, 10 and 15; destroying an enemy defense tower unlocks tech early.\n3, The blast shield is locked and the Terror Drone starts with F enabled\n4, Bounties are removed\n5, Only two tier 4 warships may be built, and the water surface is raised.\n6, Celestial power plants were rebalanced, less money early and stronger later."
END

SCRIPT:text1
"电厂 = 油井 。每一阶段上限：5  ，  7   ， 9 ，11 。\n玩家建筑出的兵会统计进入计数器 ，每回合会刷出来 （之后有空做出和酒馆一样的抽卡）。AI暂时是全升级。（还没做同步升级）。\n每一阶段率先摧毁对面塔的一方会获得奖励\n 玩家同时拥有t4高科AI会获得一个军校"
END

SCRIPT:text1?english
"Power plants = oil wells. Cap per stage 5, 7, 9 and 11.\nUnits you build are counted and respawned every round (a crate-style draw system will come later). The AI is fully upgraded for now (shared upgrades are not done yet).\nThe side that destroys the enemy tower first in each stage gets a reward.\nA player who owns tier 4 high-tech gives the AI a military academy."
END

